READING
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  - The false test-timer expiry at ring closure is the MRM's, whichever IE520 holds the
    role: it appeared on the stack MRM (T38093, 38098) and on the standalone SA MRM here.
    It is a property of this build's MRM, not of stacking.
  - The DUT as MRC behaves to the MRP design: immediate block on link down, hold on link
    up, forward on the MRM's TopologyChange.

